proved invoice once, by wire.\n\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, sent\n- **Invoice:** INV-99625, paid in full: $7,401.36 from the operating account (due 2026-11-04)\n\nBefore paying, I checked the operating account's payment history and found no earlier payments, so this isn't a duplicate. I also attached a unique ID to the request so it can't go out twice if it gets resent. The amount is under the $10,000 limit, so controller approval wasn't needed.\n\nI left Delta Printworks's other two invoices alone. INV-86330 was already paid, and INV-99666 ($5,586.95) is still a draft waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}